# Precinct Assault unit ordering path (spawner chain), retail units only.
#
# Line format: name <ops> <inputs> | <observed>
#   name     one token, no spaces
#   ops      comma separated, before the inputs:
#              drain:TOP:BOT:ELAPSED  raise TOP burst orders (bits 8..11) and
#                                     BOT timed orders (bits 12..15) on record
#                                     one, then run one frame of
#                                     gUpdateRegisteredSpawners(ELAPSED)
#              cmd:ID:CODE:MODE       gApplySpawnerCommandById
#   inputs   key=value, applied after the per-case reset; the in_* prefix
#            marks fields that are also observed
#   observed key=value after the `|`
#
# Covered units: func_800616A0 gUpdateRegisteredSpawners, func_8006125C
# gTrySpawnRegisteredUnit, func_8006158C gApplySpawnerCommandById.
noop drain:0:0:0 | ops=0 total=0 count=3 spawnCalls=0 scriptCalls=0
one_order_drains_one_burst_slot drain:1:0:0 | ops=0 total=1 count=2 spawnCalls=1 scriptCalls=2
two_orders_drain_two_slots drain:2:0:0 | ops=0 total=2 count=1 spawnCalls=2
